<title>INDIA: India produced 10,263 tonnes zinc in June.</title>
<headline>India produced 10,263 tonnes zinc in June.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 10,263 tonnes of zinc in June against a target of 11,600 tonnes, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed    June,1997	Cumulative output</p>
<p>	   capacity   -------------   -------------------</p>
<p>	   (annual)	Actual	 Apr-Jun 97  Apr-Jun 96</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> HZL     152,000	 8,454	    29,491	23,178</p>
<p> BZL	30,000	 1,809	     5,096	 5,150</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Total   182,000	10,263	    34,587	28,328</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
